WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
The one wearing Chinese clothes just now

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:02,960
Also a girlfriend

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,840
I've seen her on the flyover before

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,320
What a coincidence that she is setting up a stall to tell fortunes

5
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:11,230
You asked her to tell your fortune, but she didn't look good.

6
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,910
I took another look at that time

7
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:14,230
No class in the morning

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:17,340
I'll go for a walk inside the school and accompany you.

9
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,900
I walked around the school on the first day

10
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,080
In front is the teaching area

11
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,640
The road on the right leads to the training hall

12
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:23,760
you are here

13
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:33,850
There's actually someone who looks familiar

14
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:40,780
We are really enemies, let's go on a narrow road, etc.

15
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,300
Didn't you hear Lingyun talking to you?

16
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:46,630
It turns out that I was uneducated when I thought about it.

17
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,400
Stop saying that

18
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:51,590
So anxious to protect the Lord

19
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:53,540
Are you Su Lingyun’s dog?

20
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:55,150
Does the Zhao family know?
